<title>UK: Kredietbank sets 200 mln guilder perpetual bond.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank sets 200 mln guilder perpetual bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated perpetual bond was announced by joint lead managers Kredietbank and Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDIETBANK INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  KREDIETBANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DFL   COUPON    *6.25	MATURITY    PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.11    PAY DATE    23.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.86     SPREAD	**</p>
<p> LISTING    AMST	DENOMS (K) 5-10</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST 10-YEARS AND THEN 10-YEAR BENCHMARK</p>
<p>		 PLUS 250 BP THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		 CALLABLE AT PAR EACH 10-YEARS.</p>
<p>	    ** +69 BP OVER DSL FEB 2007 BOND TO THE FIRST CALL.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
